{"id":327,"slug":"327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-trong-typescript","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Types Nhập Môn","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Type narrowing là gì? Các cách narrow type trong TypeScript?","question_en":"What is type narrowing? What are the ways to narrow a type in TypeScript?","answer_vi":"Type narrowing là thu hẹp type trong code branch dựa trên kiểm tra. TypeScript tự động narrow trong if/else, switch, ternary.\n\n```typescript\nfunction process(val: string | number | Date) {\n  if (typeof val === 'string') return val.toUpperCase(); // typeof\n  if (val instanceof Date) return val.toISOString();    // instanceof\n  return val.toFixed(2);                                 // number\n}\n\n// User-defined type guard\nfunction isUser(obj: unknown): obj is User {\n  return typeof obj === 'object' && obj !== null && 'id' in obj;\n}\n```","answer_en":"Type narrowing refines a type within a code branch based on checks. TypeScript automatically narrows within if/else, switch, and ternary expressions.\n\n```typescript\nfunction process(val: string | number | Date) {\n  if (typeof val === 'string') return val.toUpperCase(); // typeof\n  if (val instanceof Date) return val.toISOString();    // instanceof\n  return val.toFixed(2);                                 // number\n}\n\n// User-defined type guard\nfunction isUser(obj: unknown): obj is User {\n  return typeof obj === 'object' && obj !== null && 'id' in obj;\n}\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Type narrowing là thu hẹp type trong code branch dựa trên kiểm tra.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">TypeScript tự động narrow trong if/else, switch, ternary.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function process(val: string | number | Date) {\n  if (typeof val === 'string') return val.toUpperCase(); // typeof\n  if (val instanceof Date) return val.toISOString();    // instanceof\n  return val.toFixed(2);                                 // number\n}\n\n// User-defined type guard\nfunction isUser(obj: unknown): obj is User {\n  return typeof obj === 'object' &amp;&amp; obj !== null &amp;&amp; 'id' in obj;\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">process</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">val</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> | <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> val === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;string&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toUpperCase</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// typeof</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (val <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">instanceof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toISOString</span>();    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// instanceof</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toFixed</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);                                 <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// number</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// User-defined type guard</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">obj</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span></span>): obj is <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> obj === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; obj !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> obj;\n}</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Type narrowing refines a type within a code branch based on checks.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">TypeScript automatically narrows within if/else, switch, and ternary expressions.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function process(val: string | number | Date) {\n  if (typeof val === 'string') return val.toUpperCase(); // typeof\n  if (val instanceof Date) return val.toISOString();    // instanceof\n  return val.toFixed(2);                                 // number\n}\n\n// User-defined type guard\nfunction isUser(obj: unknown): obj is User {\n  return typeof obj === 'object' &amp;&amp; obj !== null &amp;&amp; 'id' in obj;\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">process</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">val</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> | <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> | <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> val === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;string&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toUpperCase</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// typeof</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (val <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">instanceof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Date</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toISOString</span>();    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// instanceof</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> val.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toFixed</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);                                 <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// number</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// User-defined type guard</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">obj</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span></span>): obj is <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> obj === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; obj !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> obj;\n}</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"TypeScript — Narrowing","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/narrowing.html"},{"label":"TypeScript — Using type predicates","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/narrowing.html#using-type-predicates"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","title":"Union types và intersection types là gì?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/328-as-keyword-type-assertion-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","title":"as keyword (type assertion) là gì? Khi nào dùng?"},{"url":"/q/329-non-null-assertion-operator-la-gi","title":"Non-null assertion operator (!) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/330-tuple-type-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Tuple type trong TypeScript là gì?"}]}